! C2H7O3Cl | RHF/UHF instability check
! Single point at the NSERCH=0 equilibrium-search starting geometry from
! caa005bIRCCML1stdef2TZVPP / ...TZVPPa / ...TZVPPb.
!
! Purpose: caa005bIRCCML1stdef2TZVPPb (analytic gradient AND analytic Hessian,
! no numerical differentiation anywhere) still showed the same runaway pattern
! as the earlier SEMINUM runs -- energy dropping far faster than the ~0.1 A
! of nuclear motion could account for, and the approximate Hessian's leading
! curvature eigenvalue growing steadily more negative (-14.7 -> -33.0 across
! 4 steps). That rules out numerical noise as the cause. This test checks the
! remaining hypothesis directly: does a genuine lower-energy solution exist
! that the closed-shell RHF/RKS reference cannot represent?
!
! Method: run UHF with alpha/beta symmetry deliberately broken via
! $GUESS MIX=.TRUE. (mixes HOMO/LUMO before the first SCF cycle so UHF does
! not just reconverge back to the RHF solution). Same charge/multiplicity
! (neutral singlet) as the RHF run -- this is an open-shell-singlet /
! broken-symmetry test, not a change of spin state.
!
! Reference value to compare against:
! RHF/wB97X-D energy at this exact geometry = -491.6712565 (from
! caa005bIRCCML1stdef2TZVPPb, NSERCH=0). If UHF converges to something
! meaningfully lower than this, that confirms an RHF instability.

 $CONTRL SCFTYP=UHF RUNTYP=ENERGY DFTTYP=wB97X-D
         COORD=UNIQUE MULT=1 ICHARG=0 NOSYM=1 MAXIT=200
 $END
 $GUESS GUESS=HUCKEL MIX=.TRUE. $END
 $BASIS BASNAM(1)=clbas,cbas,cbas,obas,hbas,hbas,
          obas,obas,hbas,hbas,hbas,hbas,hbas $END
 $SCF CONV=1.0D-6 DIRSCF=.TRUE. $END
 $PCM SOLVNT=WATER $END
 $SYSTEM MWORDS=100 MEMDDI=200 $END

 $DATA
Chloroacetaldehyde hydrate and water -- UHF stability check
C1
Cl   17.0   3.31777   0.19618   0.40668
C     6.0   2.24118   0.90662  -0.95961
C     6.0   3.04189   1.88482  -1.77661
O     8.0   2.47874   2.79975  -2.40567
H     1.0   1.37854   1.36717  -0.48364
H     1.0   1.95549   0.05691  -1.58084
O     8.0   3.58112   0.05498  -3.89961
O     8.0   3.79699   2.62132  -4.86879
H     1.0   3.58756   3.03704  -5.71005
H     1.0   3.65634   0.88740  -4.40943
H     1.0   2.96923  -0.51508  -4.37329
H     1.0   4.12539   1.74751  -1.81197
H     1.0   3.29383   3.07126  -4.16999
 $END


